PIE800 [*] Unnecessary spread `**`
 --> PIE800.py:1:14
  |
1 | {"foo": 1, **{"bar": 1}}  # PIE800
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^
2 |
3 | {**{"bar": 10}, "a": "b"}  # PIE800
  |
help: Remove unnecessary dict
  |
1 - {"foo": 1, **{"bar": 1}}  # PIE800
1 + {"foo": 1, "bar": 1}  # PIE800
  |

